OL,4,CFuture of hostel secured after         
OL,5,CNational Trust deal                    
OL,6,GThe future of a hostel in the Surrey   
OL,7,GHills has been secured after a lease   
OL,8,Gwas agreed between a group of          
OL,9,Gvolunteers and the National Trust.     
OL,11,FTanners Hatch, which sits on the       
OL,12,FPolesden Lacey Estate in the Surrey    
OL,13,FHills, was operated by the Youth       
OL,14,FHostel Association for 79 years until  
OL,15,Fits closure in 2025.                   
OL,17,FThe volunteers, many of whom first met 
OL,18,Fwhile staying at the hostel in the     
OL,19,F1970s, have formed a community         
OL,20,Finterest company (CIC) and intend to   
OL,21,Frun Tanners Hatch on an independent    
OL,22,Fbasis from early next year.       G2/4 
