OL,4,CMan charged with raping woman on       
OL,5,CBrighton beach                         
OL,6,GA 28-year-old man has been charged     
OL,7,Gwith raping a woman on Brighton beach  
OL,8,Gin August.                             
OL,10,FSussex Police said a woman, aged in    
OL,11,Fher 20s, had reported the attack near  
OL,12,Fthe i360 on the night of 4 August.     
OL,14,FOleksandr Bryndzei, from Stratford,    
OL,15,Fwas arrested the following day on      
OL,16,Fsuspicion of his involvement, said the 
OL,17,Fforce. He was conditionally bailed     
OL,18,Fwhile wider enquiries took place.      
OL,20,FBryndzei was rearrested on Friday and  
OL,21,Fcharged with two counts of rape, it    
OL,22,Fconfirmed.                        G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
